            "type": "TEXT",
            "data": "import org.apache.spark.sql.functions.{col, split, lower, array_contains}\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34msplit_countries_col\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.Column\u001b[0m \u003d split(lower(countries_en), ,, -1)\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34mjapan_italy_filter\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.Column\u001b[0m \u003d (array_contains(split(lower(countries_en), ,, -1), italy) OR array_contains(split(lower(countries_en), ,, -1), japan))\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34msource_df_1\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.Dataset[org.apache.spark.sql.Row]\u001b[0m \u003d [code: double, url: string ... 207 more fields]\n"
