      "text": "%spark\n// Remplacer les nulls par \u0027unknown\u0027 en premier\nval  source_df_5\u003d source_df_4.withColumn(\n    \"environmental_score_grade\",\n    when(\n        col(\"environmental_score_grade\").isNull,\n        \"unknown\"\n    ).otherwise(col(\"environmental_score_grade\"))\n)\n// Appliquer la logique de remplacement pour les \u0027unknown\u0027\n.withColumn(\n    \"environmental_score_grade\",\n    when(\n        col(\"environmental_score_grade\") \u003d\u003d\u003d\"unknown\",\n        when(col(\"environmental_score_score\") \u003e\u003d 80, \"a\")\n        .when(col(\"environmental_score_score\") \u003e\u003d 60, \"b\")\n        .when(col(\"environmental_score_score\") \u003e\u003d 40, \"c\")\n        .when(col(\"environmental_score_score\") \u003e\u003d 20, \"d\")\n        .when(col(\"environmental_score_score\") \u003e\u003d 0, \"e\")\n        .otherwise(\"unknown\") \n    ).otherwise(col(\"environmental_score_grade\"))\n)",
      "user": "anonymous",
